    },
    {
      "item": "Market Risk The Group manages market risk by monitoring currency risk and interest rate risk. The Board of Directors sets limits on the level of exposure by currency and in total for both overnight and intra-day positions, which are monitored daily. Moreover, hedging strategies are used to ensure that positions are maintained within the established limits. The Group continued to closely monitor foreign exchange positions and exchange rate movements to mitigate the risk of revaluation losses. All key metrics, includ- ing LCR, NSFR, and NOP, are maintained within internal and regulatory limits.",
      "1": "The Group manages market risk by monitoring currency risk and interest rate risk. The Board of Directors sets limits on the level of exposure by currency and in total for both overnight and intra-day positions, which are monitored daily. Moreover, hedging strategies are used to ensure that positions are maintained within the established limits.",
      "2": "The Group continued to closely monitor foreign exchange positions and exchange rate movements to mitigate the risk of revaluation losses. All key metrics, includ- ing LCR, NSFR, and NOP, are maintained within internal and regulatory limits.",
